---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Base title="发布工作流 — make release 完全指南">
  <main class="narrow page">
    <h1 class="page-title">发布工作流</h1>
    <p class="page-lede">make release 完全指南：安全检查、版本推断与交互式预览</p>

    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="section-heading">快速开始</h2>
      <div class="code-block">
        <code><span class="prompt">❯</span> make release          <span class="comment"># 交互式发布（推荐）</span>
<span class="prompt">❯</span> make release-quick    <span class="comment"># 自动化模式（保留 dry-run）</span>
<span class="prompt">❯</span> make release-rehearse <span class="comment"># 只排练完整检查，不修改仓库</span></code>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="section-heading">发布流程</h2>

      <div class="workflow-steps">
        <div class="workflow-step">
          <span class="step-num">1</span>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3>Pre-flight 检查</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>✓ 验证在 <code>dev</code> 或 <code>main</code> 分支；从 <code>main</code> 启动时自动切换到 <code>dev</code></li>
              <li>✓ 检查工作目录干净</li>
              <li>✓ 运行所有测试 (<code>make test</code>)</li>
              <li>✓ 运行 clippy (<code>make clippy</code>)</li>
              <li>✓ 运行格式检查 (<code>make fmt</code>) 并确认当前提交的 CI 状态</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="workflow-step">
          <span class="step-num">2</span>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3>版本推断</h3>
            <p>脚本自动分析自上次 tag 以来的提交：</p>
            <table class="matrix-table">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th>提交类型</th>
                  <th>版本升级</th>
                  <th>示例</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr>
                  <td><code>feat!</code> 或 <code>BREAKING CHANGE</code></td>
                  <td><strong>Major</strong></td>
                  <td>1.0.0 → 2.0.0</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td><code>feat</code></td>
                  <td><strong>Minor</strong></td>
                  <td>0.7.0 → 0.8.0</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td><code>fix</code>/<code>refactor</code>/<code>perf</code></td>
                  <td><strong>Patch</strong></td>
                  <td>0.7.0 → 0.7.1</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="workflow-step">
          <span class="step-num">3</span>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3>交互式预览</h3>
            <p>你将看到：</p>
            <ul>
              <li>当前版本和上次 tag</li>
              <li>推断的版本升级</li>
              <li>提交摘要（features、fixes 数量）</li>
              <li>Changelog 预览</li>
              <li>覆盖版本的选项（major/minor/patch/custom）</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="workflow-step">
          <span class="step-num">4</span>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3>Dry Run</h3>
            <p>执行前，你将看到将要发生的操作：</p>
            <ul>
              <li>版本升级</li>
              <li>Changelog 生成</li>
              <li>创建 release 分支与 PR</li>
              <li>版本、兼容性矩阵与 Changelog 更新</li>
              <li>CI 门禁、Tag 与 CD 产物验证</li>
              <li>crates.io 与 Homebrew 发布</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="workflow-step">
          <span class="step-num">5</span>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3>Release PR 与 CI</h3>
            <p>确认后，脚本先：</p>
            <ol>
              <li>从 <code>dev</code> 创建 <code>release/vX.Y.Z</code> 分支</li>
              <li>升级 workspace 版本并更新兼容性矩阵</li>
              <li>生成、验证并提交 <code>CHANGELOG.md</code></li>
              <li>创建指向 <code>main</code> 的 PR，等待所有 CI 通过后 squash merge</li>
            </ol>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="workflow-step">
          <span class="step-num">6</span>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3>Tag 与 CD 验证</h3>
            <p>合并后创建 <code>vX.Y.Z</code> tag。CD 会构建多平台安装包、生成 SBOM、签名产物、创建 GitHub Release 并更新 Homebrew。脚本会等待 CD 完成并检查 Release 确实含有可下载产物，不会把“只推送了 tag”当成发布成功。</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="workflow-step">
          <span class="step-num">7</span>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3>crates.io 与分支回同步</h3>
            <p>CD 在配置 <code>CARGO_REGISTRY_TOKEN</code> 时按依赖顺序发布全部公开 crate；本地流程也会提供手动补发选项。最后将 <code>main</code> 合并回 <code>dev</code> 并推送，避免两条长期分支漂移。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="section-heading">发布到 crates.io</h2>

      <h3>前置条件</h3>
      <ol>
        <li>
          <strong>Crates.io 账号</strong>：
          <ul>
            <li>在 https://crates.io 注册</li>
            <li>验证邮箱</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>GitHub Actions 认证（推荐）</strong>：
          <div class="code-block">
            <code><span class="comment"># Repository Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions</span>
CARGO_REGISTRY_TOKEN=&lt;your-token&gt;</code>
          </div>
          <p>本地补发时可运行 <code>cargo login</code>，或仅在当前 shell 中设置 <code>CARGO_REGISTRY_TOKEN</code>。不要把 token 写入仓库文件。</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>验证 Crate 元数据</strong>：
          <div class="code-block">
            <code><span class="comment"># 检查包是否就绪</span>
<span class="prompt">❯</span> cargo package --list
<span class="prompt">❯</span> cargo package --no-verify</code>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>

      <h3>发布选项</h3>
      <div class="options-grid">
        <div class="option-card">
          <h4>选项 A：CD 自动发布（推荐）</h4>
          <div class="code-block">
            <code><span class="comment"># 配置 CARGO_REGISTRY_TOKEN 后，推送 tag 即触发</span>
<span class="prompt">❯</span> make release</code>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="option-card">
          <h4>选项 B：本地补发</h4>
          <div class="code-block">
            <code><span class="prompt">❯</span> make stage-skills-for-publish
<span class="prompt">❯</span> cargo release publish --execute --no-confirm \
    --registry crates-io --allow-dirty
<span class="prompt">❯</span> make clean-staged-skills</code>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="option-card">
          <h4>选项 C：暂不发布</h4>
          <div class="code-block">
            <code><span class="comment"># 未配置 token 时 CD 会记录 warning 并跳过</span>
<span class="comment"># 可在后续重跑 workflow 或按选项 B 补发</span></code>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="section-heading">注意事项</h2>
      <div class="callout callout-warning">
        <h3>⚠️ crates.io 版本不可删除</h3>
        <p>一旦发布到 crates.io，版本<strong>无法删除或修改</strong>。只能 yank（隐藏），不能删除。必须发布新版本来修复问题。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="callout callout-info">
        <h3>ℹ️ 发布前检查清单</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>所有测试通过</li>
          <li>Clippy 无警告</li>
          <li>文档完整（<code>cargo doc --no-deps</code>）</li>
          <li>CHANGELOG 已更新</li>
          <li>README 中的版本号已更新（如需要）</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="section-heading">已发布的 Crates</h2>
      <table class="matrix-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Crate</th>
            <th>说明</th>
            <th>链接</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><code>gitflow-cli</code></td>
            <td>主 CLI 应用（二进制名 <code>gf</code>）</td>
            <td><a href="https://crates.io/crates/gitflow-cli">crates.io →</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>gitflow-core</code></td>
            <td>核心库</td>
            <td><a href="https://crates.io/crates/gitflow-core">crates.io →</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>gitflow-cli-adapter-utils</code></td>
            <td>平台 CLI 适配器共享工具</td>
            <td><a href="https://crates.io/crates/gitflow-cli-adapter-utils">crates.io →</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>gitflow-github</code></td>
            <td>GitHub 平台支持</td>
            <td><a href="https://crates.io/crates/gitflow-github">crates.io →</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>gitflow-gitlab</code></td>
            <td>GitLab 平台支持</td>
            <td><a href="https://crates.io/crates/gitflow-gitlab">crates.io →</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>gitflow-gitcode</code></td>
            <td>GitCode 平台支持</td>
            <td><a href="https://crates.io/crates/gitflow-gitcode">crates.io →</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>gitflow-jev</code></td>
            <td>Jev 类型化决策集成</td>
            <td><a href="https://crates.io/crates/gitflow-jev">crates.io →</a></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>

    <section class="section cta-band">
      <h2 class="cta-heading">准备好发布了吗？</h2>
      <p>运行 <code>make release</code> 开始你的第一次发布</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://github.com/byx-darwin/gitflow-cli/blob/main/scripts/release.sh">查看发布脚本 →</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .code-block {
    background: var(--gf-code-bg, #1e1e2e);
    color: var(--gf-code-fg, #cdd6f4);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .code-block code {
    white-space: pre;
  }

  .code-block .prompt {
    color: var(--gf-teal, #89b4fa);
    margin-right: 0.5rem;
  }

  .code-block .comment {
    color: #6c7086;
  }

  .workflow-steps {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .workflow-step {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .step-num {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 3rem;
    height: 3rem;
    background: var(--gf-orange, #fab387);
    color: white;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  .step-content {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .step-content h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  h3 {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  ul, ol {
    margin: 1rem 0;
    padding-left: 2rem;
  }

  li {
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  code {
    background: var(--gf-code-inline-bg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05));
    padding: 0.2em 0.4em;
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.9em;
  }

  .options-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .option-card {
    background: var(--gf-card-bg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02));
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--gf-border, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1));
  }

  .option-card h4 {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .callout {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
    border-left: 4px solid;
  }

  .callout-warning {
    background: rgba(250, 179, 135, 0.1);
    border-color: var(--gf-orange, #fab387);
  }

  .callout-info {
    background: rgba(137, 180, 250, 0.1);
    border-color: var(--gf-teal, #89b4fa);
  }

  .callout h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .callout ul {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0 0;
  }
</style>
